+config MEMORIA_PLAYBACK_STOP
+    bool "Arm MultiNet stop keywords during playback"
+    depends on BOARD_TYPE_MEMORIA_ESP_VOCAT
+    default y
+    help
+        Spoken stop stays on in the product image. A bench or keep-awake build
