+config MEMORIA_STANDBY_AFTER_PLAYBACK
+    bool "Idle after a terminal phrase instead of listening"
+    depends on BOARD_TYPE_MEMORIA_ESP_VOCAT
+    default y
+    help
+        The product image honors standby_after_playback. A bench or keep-awake
+        build passes build.sh --disable-standby-after-playback to compile that
+        branch out. The server still sets the flag. The device ignores it.
